{
  "declaredLength": 1640,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "歡迎光臨貳流餐館。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B618FCE514981E88CB36D419910992830020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您要挑戰全餐嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A88981631162305168991055CEFF1F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哥哥我來請客，\n妳好好享受美食吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E554E562114F868ACB5BA2FF0C000A59B3597D597D4EAB53D77F8E98DF542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想享受的是\n名為美食的寶可夢對戰。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F34EAB53D77684662F000A540D70BA7F8E98DF76845BF653EF59225C0D623030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我可以理解妳的心情，\n但要考量一下味道之類的問題。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EF4EE5740689E359B376845FC360C5FF0C000A4F468981800391CF4E004E0B547390534E4B985E7684554F984C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "人家想跟寶可夢一起吃飯。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA5BB660F38DDF5BF653EF59224E008D77540398EF30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今天的起司有……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n「耗時180年熟成的\n究極硬質起司」、<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n「散發的臭味會讓人一聞到\n鼻子就皺成一團的藍紋起司」，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n以及「使用了雌性阿柏怪的\n劇毒製成的洗皮起司」呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "甜點我就跟平常一樣……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n來份「刺角果＆莓莓果雪酪\n佐滿滿香草慕斯焦糖」。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "751C9EDE62115C318DDF5E735E384E006A232026202600100001BE01000A4F864EFD300C523A89D2679CFF0683938393679C96EA916A000A4F506EFF6EFF99998349615565AF71267CD6300D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "味道自不用說……\n份量看起來也很讓人滿足呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5473905381EA4E0D75288AAA20262026000A4EFD91CF770B8D774F864E5F5F888B934EBA6EFF8DB3546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃不完的時候就\n外帶回家給寶可夢吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54034E0D5B8C7684664250195C31000A59165E3656DE5BB67D665BF653EF5922542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "爸爸……\n你其實很有錢嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7238723820262026000A4F6051765BE65F886709932255CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果點什麼都沒問題……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n「～蔚藍灣產\n酒燴呆呆獸尾巴捲<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n忘記佐憂心忡忡地凝視著\n亂塗特級初榨橙橙果油的靈異少女的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n鬼斯的冰鎮福祿果～」<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我就要點這個料理囉。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太大方了……\n是在ZA登峰戰賺翻了嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A592765B94E8620262026000A662F5728005A0041767B5CF062308CFA7FFB4E8655CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不要客氣，儘管點餐吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D89815BA26C23FF0C51187BA19EDE9910542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看到精彩的寶可夢對戰，\n餐點會更添滋味。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B52307CBE5F6976845BF653EF59225C0D6230FF0C000A99109EDE670366F46DFB6ECB547330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶可夢全力以赴的樣子\n是最高級的調味料呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF653EF59225168529B4EE58D7476846A235B50000A662F67009AD87D1A76848ABF54736599546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然！我們今天不是奶奶和孫子，\n而是兩個大人一起來享受料理喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75767136FF01621150114ECA59294E0D662F59765976548C5B6B5B50FF0C000A800C662F5169500B59274EBA4E008D774F864EAB53D765997406559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你不用這麼在乎我的感受，\n我很享受一個人的時光喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E0D752890199EBC57284E4E62117684611F53D7FF0C000A62115F884EAB53D74E00500B4EBA768466425149559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要能隱藏自己的氣息，\n應該就不會被搭話了……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898180FD96B185CF81EA5DF176846C23606FFF0C000A61C98A725C314E0D670388AB642D8A714E86202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你打從心底享受\n用餐的時光呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6062535F9E5FC35E954EAB53D7000A75289910768466425149546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要細細品嚐，\n飽食中樞也會感到滿足對吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA89817D307D3054C15690FF0C000A98FD98DF4E2D6A1E4E5F6703611F52306EFF8DB35C0D542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的綿綿泡芙\n比較可愛！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176847DBF7DBF6CE18299000A6BD48F0353EF611BFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的芳香精\n才迷人呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211768482B399997CBE000A624D8FF74EBA5462FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果然厲害！貳流餐館的\n肉類料理實在一絕。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C713653B25BB3FF018CB36D41991099287684000A8089985E659974065BE657284E007D5530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "廚師阿爾貝魯的手藝\n又更上一層樓了呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5EDA5E2B963F723E8C9D9B6F7684624B85DD000A53C866F44E0A4E005C646A134E86546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然有點闊綽過頭了，\n但我也很努力，所以沒問題吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713667099EDE95CA7DBD904E982D4E86FF0C000A4F4662114E5F5F8852AA529BFF0C62404EE56C92554F984C542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要讓客人會想再次來訪，\n那正是服務生該有的態度。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818B935BA24EBA670360F3518D6B214F868A2AFF0C000A90A36B63662F670D52D9751F8A7267097684614B5EA630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    }
  ],
